Bontillidart is a blue and white [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Hydren|Hydren]] male with extremely thick-lensed glasses that appear to nearly triple his eyes in size. He's... unpracticed in interacting with other people, and often comes across as a mix between curt and downright rude.

Bontillidart operates [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/Bontillidarts|Bontillidarts]].
